  "ruleText": "Gen 501.01 Definition. \"National Society of Genetic Counselors (NSGC)\" means the national professional organization of genetic counselors, or its successor organization.\n\nSource. #10666, eff 9-10-14; ss by #14234, eff 4-12-25, EXPIRES: 4-12-35",
